### ===================================================================
### Лабораторна 5: Асинхронність
### ===================================================================

### 1. Fire-and-forget (Успішний) - Повертає відповідь миттєво
GET http://localhost:8081/api/async-demo/notify?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 2. Fire-and-forget (Помилка) - Перевірка глобального обробника (дивись консоль)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/async-demo/notify?id=-1
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 3. Паралельне виконання - Має зайняти ~1.5 сек (а не 3 сек)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/async-demo/enrich?word=apple
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 4. Обробка винятків у Future - Не падає з 500, повертає fallback текст
GET http://localhost:8081/api/async-demo/enrich?word=error
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}





















###

POST http://localhost:8080/realms/course-realm/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=backend-app&username=alice&password=alice123&grant_type=password

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.access_token);
%}
### Cards API

### Get all cards
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new card (Japanese)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/cards
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "term": "猫",
  "translation": "Кішка",
  "exampleSentence": "猫が好きです (Neko ga suki desu).",
  "language": "JA"
}

### Create a new card (Korean)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/cards
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "term": "사과",
  "translation": "Яблуко",
  "exampleSentence": "사과가 빨개요 (Sagwaga ppalgaeyo).",
  "language": "KO"
}

### Get card by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/cards/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update card (Requires ADMIN role)
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/cards/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "term": "猫 (updated)",
  "translation": "Кіт",
  "exampleSentence": "猫が寝ています。",
  "language": "JA"
}

### Delete card (Requires ADMIN role)
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/cards/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Decks API

### Get all decks
GET http://localhost:8081/api/decks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my decks
GET http://localhost:8081/api/decks/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a new deck
POST http://localhost:8081/api/decks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Basic Japanese",
  "description": "Essential Japanese words for beginners",
  "items": [
    {
      "cardId": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Get deck by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/decks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update deck
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/decks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Basic Japanese (Advanced)",
  "description": "More words added",
  "items": [
    {
      "cardId": 2
    },
    {
      "cardId": 3
    }
  ]
}

### Delete deck
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/decks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
